      "markdown": "## 53 \n\n海化公式：$S_{\\Delta}=\\sqrt{P(P-a)(P-b)(P-c)}$ (P为:$P=\\frac{a+b+c}{2}$ a；b.(为三角形边)那么：$S_{\\Delta D O C}=\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{2}\\cdot(\\frac{11}{2}-2)\\cdot(\\frac{11}{2}-4)\\cdot(\\frac{11}{2}-5)}$ \n\n$\\frac{(p=\\frac{2+4+5}{2}=\\frac{11}{2})}{=\\sqrt{\\frac{11}{2}\\cdot\\frac{7}{2}\\cdot\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}}}$ \n\n$\\frac{Q\\because S_{\\Delta D Q C}=\\frac{1}{2}\\times C Q\\times D P\\列 }{=\\frac{1}{2}\\times2\\times D P=D P}$ $D P=\\frac{\\sqrt{231}}{4}$ 根据①\n\n$\\textcircled{12}\\textcircled{2}\\pi\\textcircled{3}A B C D=9\\times\\frac{1}{6}=9D P=\\frac{9\\sqrt{231}}{4}$ 根据()$\\frac{S_{\\Delta}m A D}{S_{\\Delta}m A D+\\frac{9\\sqrt{231}}{4}}=\\frac{16}{25}$ \n\n$\\Rightarrow S_{\\Delta\\max A D}=4\\sqrt{231}(c m o d\\cdot)$ \n\n\n\n（微信公众号：实用视界）免费分享",
